0000			PRINT:      EQU     $03             ; Line 0047 ; Centronics Printer Port 
0000			PRINTST:    EQU     $07             ; Line 0048 ; Centronics Strobe (Bit 0) 
0000			RSS:        EQU     $00             ; Line 0049 ; RS232 UART Status 
